<frame id="cut_to_bedroom">
CUT TO:

INT. FAMILYHOUSE_INTERIOR_BEDROOM - DAY

Closup shot of HYPERBREPHOS sitting in the room playing with a set of 5-10 small blocks. He has built a tower of those blocks, and he knocks them down. When he knocks them down, they go flying away superfast because HYPERBREPHOS is super strong.  HYPERBREPHOS is happy and carefree, unaware that his friends are in trouble.

</frame>
<frame id="hears_call_and_runs">
We repeat the sound of GLAUX crying for help. HYPERBREPHOS perks up and becomes concerned.

GLAUX (V.O.)
ὦ Ὑπερβρέφος, βοήθει ἡμῖν.

</frame>
<frame id="hyperbrephos_runs">
HYPERBREPHOS dashes for the door. The camera zooms out to show HYPERBREPHOS running with super speed.

DIDASKALOS (V.O.)
ὁ Ὑπερβρέφος ἀκούει τὴν φωνὴν καὶ τρέχει ἐκ τῆς οἰκίας.

</frame>
<frame id="follow_shot_transition">
TRANSITION: HYPERBREPHOS dashes from FAMILYHOUSE_INTERIOR through the doorway and out toward FAMILYHOUSE_EXTERIOR_TREE.

