EXT. FAMILYHOUSE_EXTERIOR_TREE - DAY (CONTINUOUS)

CAMERA: Tracking shot arrives with HYPERBREPHOS into the action; reframe to a wide that includes all four characters.

DIDASKALOS (V.O.)
ὁ Ὑπερβρέφος λαμβάνει τὸν λίθον καὶ βάλλει τὸν λίθον κατὰ τοῦ λύκου.
ὁ λίθος τύπτει κατὰ τοῦ λύκου.
</frame>

<frame id="lukos_hit_and_falls">
We see cartoon stars circle LUKOS's head where the rock hit him. LUKOS becomes paralized like a cartoon plank and falls backwards to the ground with a thud.

</frame>
<frame id="hyperbrephos_warns_lukos">
CAMERA: Close-up on HYPERBREPHOS as he wags his finger in a gesture of no.

HYPERBREPHOS
ὦ Λύκε, μὴ φάγῃς τοὺς φίλους ἐμοὺς.

